find_max({"name", "enam", "game"}) == "enam"
find_max({"aaaaaaa", "bb" ,"cc"}) == "aaaaaaa"

Response A:
    string max="";
    int maxu=0;
    for (int i=0;i<words.size();i++)
    {
        string unique="";
